  "hero_summary_zh": "无所畏惧地向敌人大步走去，冥魂大帝击晕敌人，用他的大刀阔剑让他们心悦诚服。就算敌人稍占上风，他的终极技能可以使他再度崛起，保证他还有机会挥起宝剑。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Striding fearlessly toward his enemies, Wraith King stuns his foes and slashes them into submission. Should his enemies gain the upper hand, his self-resurrecting ultimate ensures he'll have another chance to swing his sword.",
